          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Abafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe bo baranse umugambi w’Imana kuri bo, kuko banse ko Yohana ababatiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
